{"tail":"גָּשִׁים מוּל אֲרוֹן הַקֹּדֶשׁ בְּאֵימָה. לְשַׁכֵּךְ כַּעַס "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n257.jpg","n":"119"}}
